.Dd November 11, 2026
.Dt EVQ_CTL 2
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm evq_ctl
.Nd manage an event-queue registration
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Fn evq_ctl evq op handle events cookie
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Fa op is ADD (1), MOD (2), or DEL (3).  Event bits are READABLE, WRITABLE,
HUP and SIGNALED; EDGE requests transition-triggered delivery.  A deletion
returns only after its cookie cannot be returned by a later wait.
.Sh ERRORS
.Bl -tag -width Er
.It Er EINVAL
An operation or event mask is invalid.
.It Er ENOSPC
The queue already has 4096 registrations.
.It Er EEXIST , Er ENOENT
The registration already exists or does not exist.
.El
.Sh STANDARDS
RavenBSD ABI v1.
